<title>CHINA: Peregrine up HK &amp; China Gas warrants.</title>
<headline>Peregrine up HK &amp; China Gas warrants.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peregrine Derivatives Ltd said on Thursday it had increased the issue size of the American style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong and China Gas Co Ltd by 75 million warrants to 240 million warrants.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$16.90    PREMIUM	 19.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$0.3133   GEARING	 5.4X</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT   HK$16.80    PAYDATE	 11.AUG.97</p>
<p> MATURITY	   22.JUL.98   LISTING DATE  13.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG   EXER. LOT     10,000</p>
<p> NOTE		 PHYSICAL SHARES WITH CASH ALTERNATIVE AT</p>
<p>			ISSUER'S DISCRETION</p>
<p>-- HONG KONG NEWSROOM (9852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
